{
  "raw": "# Synthetic checklist\n## Disconnected bench\n\nOnly inside the isolated synthetic laboratory:\n\n- Complete both preparations before releasing the inert fixture:\n  - [x] Seal the cobalt inlet.\n    - Example: keep the dummy gate closed.\n  - [ ] Drain the violet chamber after sealing the inlet.\n    - Limitation: use only inert samples.\n  - Condition: never connect real equipment.\n- Caveat: do not restart before both preparations finish.",
